concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Section 23"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Division: \"commencing day” means the day on which section 9 of this Act commences; \"Principal Act” has the same meaning as in Division 1 of this Part. (2) In this Division, an offence is to be taken to be a federal offence if it is an offence that would, if committed on or after the commencing day, be a federal offence for the purposes of Part IB of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, despite the fact that the offence was committed before the commencing day. Licences granted under section 19a of the Principal Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Division: \"commencing day” means the day on which section 9 of this Act commences; \"Principal Act” has the same meaning as in Division 1 of this Part. (2) In this Division, an offence is to be taken to be a federal offence if it is an offence that would, if committed on or after the commencing day, be a federal offence for the purposes of Part IB of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, despite the fact that the offence was committed before the commencing day. Licences granted under section 19a of the Principal Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "891e8cdb8ff13b76a2a958de463d5292f7a18174a5878bc2d6ce453c74ea9a4d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines terms for Division 1 of Part 1, including commencing day and Principal Act." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-act.pdf, p.59" ;
