    values:originalText "(1) In this Division: \"commencing day” means the day on which section 9 of this Act commences; \"Principal Act” has the same meaning as in Division 1 of this Part. (2) In this Division, an offence is to be taken to be a federal offence if it is an offence that would, if committed on or after the commencing day, be a federal offence for the purposes of Part IB of the Principal Act as amended by this Act, despite the fact that the offence was committed before the commencing day. Licences granted under section 19a of the Principal Act" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-24 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24 Any licence granted under section 19a of the Principal Act being a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24 ;
    values:originalText "licence in force immediately before the commencing day, continues in force, with effect from that commencing day: (a) as if it had been granted under section 19ap of the Principal Act as amended by this Act; and (b) if the period of the licence exceeds 5 years—as if the licence period ended on the commencing day or 5 years after the licence was granted, whichever happens last. Licences revoked or cancelled under section 19a of the Principal Act before commencing day" ;
    skos:definition "licence in force immediately before the commencing day, continues in force, with effect from that commencing day: (a) as if it had been granted under section 19ap of the Principal Act as amended by this Act; and (b) if the period of the licence exceeds 5 years—as if the licence period ended on the commencing day or 5 years after the licence was granted, whichever happens last. Licences revoked or cancelled under section 19a of the Principal Act before commencing day"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0b0eaffd0ee92cac34f57a7fd9b88946ef9429c20e5e2505d3196e0cb84c8cd1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Licence granted under section 19a continues in force with effect from commencing day." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
