doc:sec-26-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26(3) Section 26" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Where a sentence or order that has been passed or made under subsection 20ab (1) of the Principal Act is in force immediately before the commencing day, that sentence or order has effect, on and after that day, as if it had been passed or made under subsection 20AB (1) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act. Section 20B of the Principal Act to continue to apply for A.C.T. purposes on and after commencing day" ;
