doc:sec-51 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "51 After section 33 of the Principal Act the following section is inserted:" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Arrest without warrant “33a. (1) Where an officer has reasonable grounds to believe that a person is guilty of an offence against section 15, the officer may arrest the person without warrant. “(2) Where an officer has reasonable grounds to believe that a person has assaulted any officer in the execution of that officer’s duties, the first- mentioned officer may arrest the person without warrant.  Crimes Legislation Amendment (No. 2) No. 4, 1990 “(3) A person must not resist, obstruct or prevent the arrest of any person under this section. Penalty: $1,000. “(4) Where a person is arrested under this section, sections 212 and 213 of the Customs Act 1901 apply as though the person had been arrested under section 210 of that Act. “(5) In this section: ‘offence against section 15’ and ‘officer’ have the same respective meanings as in section 33.”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 After section 40 of the Principal Act the following section is inserted"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "in Part VI: Consultants “40a. (1) The Director may engage, under written agreements, persons having suitable qualifications and experience to perform services as consultants to the Agency. “(2) The terms and conditions of engagement of persons mentioned in subsection (1) are such as the Director determines from time to time.”." ;
    skos:definition "in Part VI: Consultants “40a. (1) The Director may engage, under written agreements, persons having suitable qualifications and experience to perform services as consultants to the Agency. “(2) The terms and conditions of engagement of persons mentioned in subsection (1) are such as the Director determines from time to time.”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "54d1dc724d97c520fcb447d11503d6c7020db3fbd3576a9c0bfe539574eeb3af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "73"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Director may engage consultants under written agreements." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
